{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1139.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"2c2e152ef37610a8388bb06ffa0a10790520d10049182690903ce40edf866583","ja":"いや～、まさか劇場の屋上で撮影やなんて。\nけど、朋花の言う通りしっくりくる感じがするな♪","zh":"哎呀～，真没想到会在剧场的屋顶上拍摄。\n不过，正如朋花所说，感觉还挺合适的呢♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1139.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"f9aa1f04dfc0096218834215b6d710f7d2dd9583033da6ec6c7997226d26bd7d","ja":"移動も楽だしね。\nそれでも亜美は眠いけど～。……あ！","zh":"移动也挺轻松的。\n话虽这么说，亚美还是好困哦～……啊！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1139.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"03ff846afca4f58f127ee2a14b2fc9ccce8db8945e6994a86b0547910e8ea77e","ja":"来てる！　来てるよ、初日の出っ！","zh":"来了！初日升起来了！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1139.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"f657e0516515f8ec80878b2e26e8d2fb0b68c35d853bebd9911552582e766ac2","ja":"うふふっ……♪\nカメラマンさん、しっかり撮ってくださいね～？","zh":"呵呵……♪\n摄影师先生，可要好好拍哦～？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1139.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"ebcbf18d5986e81eabbaf9811b1a6414bce7df496b4b9f4788657372c55e618a","ja":"そして撮影は無事に終了し……","zh":"然后拍摄顺利结束了……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1139.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"e55baff61eb64095a7ba9f9092ba8c3abc693d3da5d9dec26f5d3ed852a8c3c7","ja":"ぶっちゃけ、地味な写真になるかもって\n思ってたんだけど、めっちゃいい感じだったよね！？","zh":"说实话，本来我还以为会拍得很不起眼呢，\n结果拍得超棒的对吧！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1139.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"a1dab35ac7bfa16ee5fb121b1e100cbe801cb1f019e844138b9d4b6b949f0f9d","ja":"そやな！　いつもの屋上なのになんでやろ？\nなんや、いつもより気持ちが引き締まった、言うか。","zh":"是啊！明明是和平时一样的屋顶，怎么会这样呢？\n总觉得，心情好像比平时更紧张、更有干劲了呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1139.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"46e37dd542adb58790655965157dff67d907ca9db1f013fde067e32011dda4b4","ja":"私たちをずっと見守ってくれている場所ですから～。\nいつもの場所であり、特別な場所なのでしょう～。","zh":"因为这里是一直守护着我们的地方～\n是习以为常的地方，也是特别的地方吧～。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1139.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"7d606a7d89e56c8dbcf29379592fbbe9963ae963320b8d8514d858a997d6c3b8","ja":"あ、それやそれ！　さすが私たちの劇場やな♪\n今年もよろしく頼むで、劇場ちゃん！","zh":"啊，就是那个就是那个！真不愧是咱们的剧场啊♪\n今年也拜托你啦，小剧场！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1139.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"3217c75a6011c249b6bbb2581f86be2111f56a1a7131e57e5c1b1ae980d469d3","ja":"おかげで今年はいいスタートきれたし、\n仕事運がめっちゃ上がるかもな！","zh":"多亏这样，今年开局很不错，\n说不定工作运会大幅上升呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1139.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"b3190fb35849213626e688ed0b892954c4039852d6da1dc454630feebf7e043a","ja":"亜美は、イタズラ運も上がっちゃうかも～……。","zh":"亚美恶作剧的运气可能也会变好哦～……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1139.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"6a60bb0abed5ca5d6fb25ec25e04a2d11be918f641235b3ec87ad1207a69ecb0","ja":"おや～？　亜美ちゃん。\nイタズラがどうかしましたか～？","zh":"哎呀～？亚美。\n恶作剧怎么了吗～？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1139.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"789eeea2ed4c55457e98e0f9bfeee9da56be0825eebe0c7afaeab06b738cd760","ja":"ぎくっ！　な、なんでもないよ！\nホントにホントに！！","zh":"糟糕！没、没什么啦！\n真的真的！！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1139.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"72801878888f32bef7a7f92c79c5f5451384123b3e87451a09348478561a1857","ja":"ふふっ、せっかくの新年ですし、\n今日はそういうことにしてきましょうか～。","zh":"呵呵，难得过新年，\n今天就当作是那样吧～","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1139.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"c43e7055ce6c9008e68e3d6becb2d35c499c53e39bd44cb0f3fce6e4e8d9c816","ja":"それでは……\n今年もよろしくお願いしますね～。","zh":"那么……\n今年也请多多关照哦～","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
